---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="How Safe Is Your Facility? | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Learn about Marietta Childcare's safety protocols, security measures, and emergency procedures.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/diverse_children_sharing_toy_background.jpg" 
        alt="Safety and security" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">How Safe Is Marietta Childcare's Facility?</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Safety protocols, security measures, and emergency procedures to protect children.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare is committed to providing a safe, secure environment for all children. Marietta Childcare's safety commitment is foundational to all operations and policies.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Facility Safety Standards</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare meets all Georgia childcare licensing requirements for facility safety. Marietta Childcare's facility undergoes regular inspections to ensure compliance with safety standards. The facility at Marietta Childcare is maintained to the highest safety and sanitation standards.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's building includes safety features such as fire suppression systems and emergency exits. The facility at Marietta Childcare is designed with child safety in mind, including secure entry points and supervised outdoor areas. Marietta Childcare's maintenance staff ensures all safety equipment is functioning properly.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Security Measures</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare implements comprehensive security protocols. Security at Marietta Childcare includes controlled access to the facility with sign-in and sign-out procedures. Marietta Childcare's staff verifies the identity of all individuals picking up children.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's security measures protect children from unauthorized access. Marietta Childcare maintains updated emergency contact information for each child. Security procedures at Marietta Childcare ensure only authorized individuals have access to children.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Emergency Procedures</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare has comprehensive emergency procedures in place. Emergency procedures at Marietta Childcare include fire drills, tornado drills, and lockdown procedures. Marietta Childcare's staff practices emergency procedures regularly to ensure readiness.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's emergency plan addresses various scenarios including natural disasters and medical emergencies. Emergency procedures at Marietta Childcare ensure children are moved to safe locations quickly and calmly. Marietta Childcare maintains emergency supplies and first aid equipment.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Staff Background Checks</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare conducts thorough background checks on all staff members. Background checks at Marietta Childcare include criminal history screening and child abuse registry checks. Marietta Childcare's hiring practices prioritize child safety.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's staff undergoes background checks before employment begins. All staff members at Marietta Childcare are required to maintain current background clearance. Marietta Childcare's commitment to staff screening protects children from potential harm.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Supervision and Ratios</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare maintains appropriate staff-to-child ratios at all times. Supervision at Marietta Childcare ensures children are never left unattended. Marietta Childcare's ratios exceed Georgia licensing requirements in many age groups.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's supervision practices include constant visual monitoring of children. Staff at Marietta Childcare are trained in child supervision and safety protocols. Marietta Childcare's commitment to appropriate ratios supports children's safety and well-being.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Health and Sanitation</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare maintains rigorous health and sanitation standards. Health protocols at Marietta Childcare include handwashing, sanitizing, and cleaning procedures. Marietta Childcare's staff follows infection control practices to prevent illness transmission.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare requires current immunizations for all children. Health screening at Marietta Childcare includes daily health checks for signs of illness. Marietta Childcare's health and sanitation practices protect children from communicable diseases.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Injury Prevention</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare implements injury prevention strategies throughout the facility. Injury prevention at Marietta Childcare includes safe equipment, proper maintenance, and hazard removal. Marietta Childcare's outdoor areas are designed with safety in mind.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's staff is trained in injury prevention and first aid. Marietta Childcare maintains incident reports and reviews safety concerns regularly. Marietta Childcare's proactive approach to injury prevention protects children during all activities.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Child Abuse Prevention</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare has policies and procedures to prevent child abuse. Child abuse prevention at Marietta Childcare includes staff training on recognizing and reporting abuse. Marietta Childcare's staff is mandated to report suspected abuse to authorities.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's policies protect children from physical punishment and harsh discipline. Positive discipline strategies at Marietta Childcare support children's behavior and emotional development. Marietta Childcare's commitment to child protection is unwavering.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Medication and Medical Care</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare safely manages medications and medical care. Medication administration at Marietta Childcare follows strict protocols with parental authorization. Marietta Childcare's staff is trained in medication safety and administration.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare maintains medical records and allergy information for each child. Medical care at Marietta Childcare includes first aid and emergency response procedures. Marietta Childcare's medical protocols protect children's health and safety.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Tour Our Facility</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare welcomes families to tour the facility and learn about safety measures firsthand. Schedule a tour at Marietta Childcare to see the safe, secure environment where your child will learn and grow.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Schedule a Tour</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/faq/teacher-qualifications" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What Are Your Teacher Qualifications?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/sick-child-policy" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What's Your Sick Child Policy?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">About Marietta Childcare</a></li>
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
